6,O2a Haplogroup: Austro-Asiatic DNA in India | Helixline,https://helixline.in/blog/o2a-haplogroup-india,"In mainland Southeast Asia, O2a (M95) is widespread among Austro-Asiatic-speaking populations: Vietnam: O2a is found at frequencies of 20-40% among Vietnamese-speaking populations, particularly in northern and central Vietnam.",O’du,Austro-Asiatic
